{"messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Make a Stack class."}, {"role": "silicat", "content": "```python\nclass Stack:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._items = []\n\n    def push(self, item):\n        self._items.append(item)\n\n    def pop(self):\n        return self._items.pop()\n```"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Now add a peek method."}, {"role": "silicat", "content": "```python\nclass Stack:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._items = []\n\n    def push(self, item):\n        self._items.append(item)\n\n    def pop(self):\n        return self._items.pop()\n\n    def peek(self):\n        return self._items[-1]\n```"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Make pop and peek raise a clear error when the stack is empty."}, {"role": "silicat", "content": "```python\nclass Stack:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._items = []\n\n    def push(self, item):\n        self._items.append(item)\n\n    def pop(self):\n        if not self._items:\n            raise IndexError(\"pop from empty stack\")\n        return self._items.pop()\n\n    def peek(self):\n        if not self._items:\n            raise IndexError(\"peek from empty stack\")\n        return self._items[-1]\n```"}, {"role": "user", "content": "Add __len__ too."}, {"role": "silicat", "content": "```python\nclass Stack:\n    def __init__(self):\n        self._items = []\n\n    def push(self, item):\n        self._items.append(item)\n\n    def pop(self):\n        if not self._items:\n            raise IndexError(\"pop from empty stack\")\n        return self._items.pop()\n\n    def peek(self):\n        if not self._items:\n            raise IndexError(\"peek from empty stack\")\n        return self._items[-1]\n\n    def __len__(self):\n        return len(self._items)\n```"}]}
